{% doc %}
  Tells the MCP engine whether a proposed change must wait for a person
  (config.approval_partial). Delegates to the support desk, where admins set it
  in Assistants rather than by editing an instance constant.

  Fail-safe: the engine keeps the gate ON unless this answers an explicit false.
{% enddoc %}
{% liquid
  function answer = 'modules/support/mcp/approval'
  return answer
%}
